-**Formulas:**
-*   Input concatenation: $v_{\text{in}} = [\text{dir\_encode}(\mathbf{d})_{0:16}, \mathbf{e}_{\text{pos}}] \in \mathbb{R}^{32}$ [S1, unofficial].
-*   Hidden layer 1: $h_1 = W_1 v_{\text{in}}$ [S1, unofficial].
-*   Hidden layer 2 (depth 2): $h_2 = \text{ReLU}(h_1)$ [S1, unofficial].
-*   Output (depth 2): $c = \sigma(\text{ReLU}(h_2))$ [S1, unofficial].
-*   Output (depth $\neq$ 2): $c = \sigma(W_2 h_1)$ [S1, unofficial].
-*   Activation: $\sigma(x) = 1 / (1 + e^{-x})$ [S1, unofficial].
